cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these derived data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "habitat-radiomics-pca-lnm: code and derived data for preoperative lymph node staging in prostate cancer"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a fully automated, contrast-free
  biparametric MRI habitat radiomics model for preoperative pelvic lymph node
  metastasis in prostate cancer, with a two-level K-means decomposition,
  endpoint-driven habitat-number selection, external and prospective validation,
  and a deep-learning comparator.  verify/check_paper_numbers.py reproduces
  every number in the manuscript from the derived data that ship with the
  repository.
